      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "826C5A3D938D6817",
      "text": "¡Je, je! Una respuesta habitual.\\c\\nTiene buena visibilidad, por lo que en esta área\\nresulta sencillo observar de lejos a los Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "826C573D938D62FE",
      "text": "¡Ajá! ¡Es mi área favorita! Tiene un aire muy\\ntranquilo y relajante.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "826C583D938D64B1",
      "text": "¿Te gustan las zonas escarpadas?\\c\\nEs un área muy interesante, en ella puedes\\nencontrar electrorroca, un mineral con unas\\r\\ncaracterísticas de lo más curiosas.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_16",
      "hash64": "826C553D938D5F98",
      "text": "Los Pokémon de tipo Hielo son una monada,\\n¿a que sí?\\c\\nPero es una lástima que haga tanto frío,\\nno puedo con él.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_17",
      "hash64": "826C563D938D614B",
      "text": "Cuando necesites curar a tu equipo, no dudes\\nen usar uno de nuestros [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]terminales de curación[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\r\\n¡Los encontrarás en varios puntos del Biodomo![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_18",
      "hash64": "826C533D938D5C32",
      "text": "Bueno, señor director, es el momento.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_19",
      "hash64": "826C543D938D5DE5",
      "text": "¿Por qué es posible para los Pokémon salvajes\\nteracristalizarse en nuestra academia y por qué\\r\\nse forman cristales en el Biodomo?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "A1451A385BCF1E61",
      "text": "¿Eh? Pero si lo sabes de so... Ah, vale, ya pillo\\nla indirecta.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "A1451B385BCF2014",
      "text": "¡La respuesta la tenéis ahí arriba![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "A1451C385BCF21C7",
      "text": "Eso que pende sobre nuestras cabezas es el\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]núcleo del Biodomo[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "A1451D385BCF237A",
      "text": "Dentro hay un líquido en el que hemos disuelto\\ncierta sustancia traída directamente de Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "A1451E385BCF252D",
      "text": "El núcleo irradia energía Teracristal, que activa\\nel mecanismo que posibilita la teracristalización\\r\\nen el Biodomo y sus alrededores.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_20",
      "hash64": "8269553D938B29C1",
      "text": "¡Eso es! Es increíble, ¿no te parece?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "8269543D938B280E",
      "text": "Pero, señor director... ¿Qué es exactamente esa\\nsustancia que contiene el núcleo?\\c\\nNo se ha revelado públicamente, ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_08",
